# Boundaries

Do not write to previous WorkOS or other reference repositories. They are read-only evidence. Do not copy their architecture or wholesale code into this repo.

Do not add business databases, ORM, migrations, seeds, or destructive data operations without an explicit Owner GO.

Do not invent speculative architecture, unused modules, placeholder pages, or future framework layers before a real product path needs them.

Generalize from real products, not from theory.
